eátus vir qui súffert. p. 1202.</l><l xml:id="m-3b76fcc1-afbe-4520-b9c1-951f487aebc1" facs="#m-147d3e91-c872-4861-9231-a924db654f47" label="lyrics-like">After Septuagesima, the Allelúia and its verse are omitted.</l><l xml:id="m-90abad38-172e-411e-9123-589db28019b3" facs="#m-1ae8d69e-76de-45e0-b35f-b32adeb82e54" label="text-like">The following Tract is said instead.</l><l xml:id="m-2b25426f-392a-49fd-b065-55b56aa62152" facs="#m-9cacc702-22e7-4aa7-b445-4270328df231" label="ambiguous">Tract.</l><l xml:id="m-3203768b-603f-4fb4-a816-a000b2c34691" facs="#m-9d83b6d0-aa8a-455f-bedf-5475619e4f16" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-70afc541-9b16-41b4-a2ff-14de346a629d" facs="#m-10118ffb-c39b-45ba-b2bf-dc20f2057d82" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-fabbd10f-189b-45fe-98d3-ce5cb257ad19" facs="#m-58082437-c2cd-42f2-9149-8655f0f54888" label="lyrics-like">"Dó-mi- ni</l><l xml:id="m-adf9783c-66c3-47c5-a674-28276402d119" facs="#m-53b4dfcc-e550-4ba4-9ae1-6220e25a60e0" label="lyrics-like">fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-919078ca-b7dd-4981-8bb0-eb032a629f7c" facs="#m-69e7da72-7d87-4caa-b4c0-8e82fe295c02" label="ambiguous">Exte¬ ra</l><l xml:id="m-9662d601-6caa-449e-b2ad-f1dfc6f219b3" facs="#m-746611fa-a0f9-4805-bebe-c38303193eec" label="lyrics-like">déxte-ra Dómini</l><l xml:id="m-1f051eec-d2ef-4dd3-b753-e5d756f53aba" facs="#m-9d28ee6c-ff63-4182-b1d3-678a0d925bc1" label="lyrics-like">exaltá¬ vit</l><l xml:id="m-ae23606a-981e-45ab-b443-6cac22aac66a" facs="#m-50af4176-dfd6-4de0-b677-50ffd0e38088" label="lyrics-like">cit vir- tú-tem:</l><l xml:id="m-7da03144-3ca4-4adb-9904-a6b8b3bda82b" facs="#m-fde79d83-3186-4b75-b0e7-9d3e7a6973d2" label="lyrics-like">déxte-ra Dó¬ mi-ni fé-cit virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-f34eb58f-64c6-4fbc-9b32-f2e1568e0dae" facs="#m-65e32719-8c54-4480-933d-eea4d8d5c0f1" label="ambiguous">tem.</l><l xml:id="m-936a9587-c9cb-40a5-aef5-c8b4facc807c" facs="#m-1cf87cc6-57e1-4c24-a2a5-79281c13bd3c" label="ambiguous">me,</l><l xml:id="m-03ed5d65-efe4-4294-9c17-879945ce0ae8" facs="#m-fd0a5134-7d1e-4ebd-b1d4-22706f7b12e1" label="lyrics-like">V. Non mó-ri- ar, sed ví-vam,</l><l xml:id="m-d890b6f7-6257-4f4d-91f8-7881093e0368" facs="#m-e0f567aa-6d9b-4388-a9f5-3da26116e8ee" label="lyrics-like">et narrá¬ bo</l><l xml:id="m-c6f705fc-7d02-42bf-83ec-cdbea383df47" facs="#m-5cc1a32b-6708-47b4-94fd-bb79c6d1d6cd" label="lyrics-like">V. Castí¬</l><l xml:id="m-e14255f3-166d-4ece-abee-5f36b04f4414" facs="#m-47b18382-49c1-40be-a186-5dae9417c387" label="lyrics-like">ó-pe-ra Dó- mi-ni.</l><l xml:id="m-75fe7129-bcef-4108-aa33-a630871e2fa9" facs="#m-4be4225d-376d-48a4-8acc-9827b4f1f9c4" label="lyrics-like">gans castigávit me Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e92d5450-3e6b-49fe-be51-ef95454768f9" facs="#m-7536b951-42d0-480e-85a9-c7bf154f1116" label="ambiguous">minus,</l><l xml:id="m-679f7705-2652-4296-9fcf-58cdc6c0ee77" facs="#m-1ac09b28-5209-462a-bf54-f73451de7167" label="lyrics-like">et mór¬</l><l xml:id="m-1302f10d-8796-4cfd-ae02-9374ac5d4870" facs="#m-e2e63dc7-7e9e-412d-9080-415703e5af95" label="lyrics-like">non trá¬ di- dit me.</l><l xml:id="m-caff176a-a406-4188-92f7-3846ad991026" facs="#m-09925c40-c748-4c70-a716-36c6475dee86" label="ambiguous">ti</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
